# Sprint: Product Discovery Data Architecture — Critical Fixes

**Sprint ID:** PDDA-SPRINT-1
**Date:** 2026-04-01
**Source:** `audit-reports/PRODUCT_DISCOVERY_DATA_ARCHITECTURE_AUDIT.md`
**Target Grade:** B- → A- (Architecture Health 7/10 → 9/10)
**Verified Gaps:** 8 real issues (3 Critical, 5 High)

---

## Pre-Sprint Lessons Applied

### Critical Severity Lessons (MUST APPLY)

| Lesson | Source | Application |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| **GROQ schema verification** | `failures/groq-schema-assumption.md` | Verify field types before reference syntax usage |
| **Reference syntax on non-ref fields** | `failures/groq-reference-syntax.md` | Brand is string, NOT reference — fix before GROQ queries |
| **Signal density optimization** | `prompting/signal-density-optimization.md` | Compress context before execution — 10× token reduction |
| **Sequencing enforcement** | `auto-lessons.md:472-527` | Pass 1→2→3, Layer 1→2→3→4 mandatory |

### High Severity Lessons (MUST APPLY)

| Lesson | Source | Application |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| **Data verification before hypothesis** | `failures/debug-data-assumption.md` | Verify actual data before code changes |
| **Pre-flight baseline check** | `workflows/pre-flight-baseline-check.md` | Verify baseline build before sprint work |
| **Parallel data fetching** | `patterns/parallel-data-fetching.md` | Use Promise.all for independent fetches |
| **VFS catalog architecture** | `patterns/vfs-catalog-architecture.md` | Leverage O(1) lookups, avoid recursive queries |

---

## Scope Lock Rules

**ABSOLUTE CONSTRAINTS — No Exceptions:**

1. **NO globals.css modifications** — All styling via Tailwind utility classes only
2. **NO homepage changes** — Product discovery pages only
3. **NO data structure changes outside Brand scope** — Isolate migrations to SC8
4. **NO client-side state management changes** — Use existing nuqs patterns
5. **NO arbitrary schema field additions** — Brand reference only, no scope creep
6. **NO Suspense boundary changes outside product discovery** — Isolate to category pages

