## Scope Contract 2: Sanity Typegen Integration — Gap #3 (CRITICAL)

### Target State
All product-related types use generated Sanity types. Manual type definitions eliminated. Full compile-time type safety for GROQ queries.

### DoD (Definition of Done)

**Pass 1: Skeleton (Type Analysis)**
- [ ] Audit all manual Product interfaces
- [ ] Map manual types to generated `sanity.types.ts` equivalents
- [ ] Identify optional fields requiring null checks

**Pass 2: Data (Type Migration)**
- [ ] Replace manual `Product` interface with `Pick<SanityProduct, ...>`
- [ ] Update `brand` field to use generated reference type
- [ ] Add null checks for optional `image` field
- [ ] Update all dependent client components

**Pass 3: Build (Validation & CI)**
- [ ] Layer 1: Structure — Type imports only, no runtime changes
- [ ] Layer 2: Layout — N/A (type-only change)
- [ ] Layer 3: Surface — N/A (type-only change)
- [ ] Layer 4: Interaction — N/A (type-only change)
- [ ] Add `npm run typegen` to pre-build step
- [ ] Verify no `any` types remain in product data flow

### Verification

```bash
# Build gate
npm run build

# Type generation
npm run typegen

# Type checking
npx tsc --noEmit

# Specification tests
npx vitest run tests/catalogue/type-safety.test.ts
```

### Files Modified
- `@/sanity/lib/products/getProductsByVfsKeys.ts`
- `@/sanity.types.ts` (regenerate)
- `@/app/components/product/ProductCard.tsx`
- `@/app/components/product/ProductGrid.tsx`

