### DoD (Definition of Done)

**Pass 1: Skeleton (Validation Script)**
- [ ] Create `validateProductKeys()` function in build script
- [ ] Extract all unique keys from `slotMetadataMap`
- [ ] Define `OrphanedKey` interface for reporting

**Pass 2: Data (Implementation)**
- [ ] Query all products for `catalogueLocationKeys`
- [ ] Check each key exists in `allValidIds` set
- [ ] Collect orphaned keys with product ID references
- [ ] Generate console.table report

**Pass 3: Build (Integration)**
- [ ] Layer 1: Structure — Add validation call to build script
- [ ] Layer 2: Layout — N/A (script only)
- [ ] Layer 3: Surface — N/A (script only)
- [ ] Layer 4: Interaction — N/A (script only)
- [ ] Fail build on orphaned keys (configurable)
- [ ] Add cleanup script reference to error message

