## Scope Contract 7: Filter Architecture Clarification — Gap #8 (MEDIUM)

### Target State
Single source of truth for filtering. Server does ALL filtering, client removes duplicate brand-only filter.

### DoD (Definition of Done)

**Pass 1: Skeleton (Strategy Decision)**
- [ ] Document decision: Server-driven filtering (URL-based)
- [ ] Update architecture notes: hybrid → server-only
- [ ] Define URL filter param structure

**Pass 2: Data (Server Implementation)**
- [ ] Verify GROQ filter clause applies ALL active filters
- [ ] Remove client-side filter logic from `CategoryPageClient`
- [ ] Update `getProductsByVfsKeys` to handle all filter types
- [ ] Ensure filter state survives hydration correctly

**Pass 3: Build (Integration)**
- [ ] Layer 1: Structure — No changes (data layer only)
- [ ] Layer 2: Layout — No changes
- [ ] Layer 3: Surface — No changes
- [ ] Layer 4: Interaction — Filter application instant (page reload)
- [ ] Desktop (1280px): Filter behavior unchanged
- [ ] Mobile (375px): Filter behavior unchanged

### Verification

