## Execution Sequence

**Sprint Order:** SC2 → SC3 → SC4 → SC5 → SC6 → SC7 → SC1 → SC8

| Order | Contract | Rationale |
|-------|----------|-----------|
| 1 | SC2: Typegen | Foundation for all other changes |
| 2 | SC3: Dynamic Filters | Enables real filter data for testing |
| 3 | SC4: Server-Side Sort | Removes client blocking before Suspense |
| 4 | SC5: Suspense Boundaries | Streaming infrastructure |
| 5 | SC6: Data Integrity | Validates data before pagination |
| 6 | SC7: Filter Architecture | Clean single-source-of-truth |
| 7 | SC1: Pagination | Build on clean type + filter + sort foundation |
| 8 | SC8: Brand Model | Largest change, last to minimize conflicts |

