## Summary

**Total Estimated Effort:** 45 hours
**Scope Contracts:** 8 (2 Critical, 5 High, 1 Medium)
**Risk Level:** Medium-High (data migration in SC8)
**Expected Outcome:** Architecture Health 7/10 → 9/10, Data Consistency 6/10 → 9/10

**Key Deliverables:**
1. Full type safety via Sanity Typegen
2. Dynamic CMS-driven filters (no hardcoding)
3. Server-side sorting (no client blocking)
4. Streaming with Suspense boundaries
5. Data integrity validation in build process
6. Single-source-of-truth filter architecture
7. Bounded product queries with pagination
8. Brand as reference document (data model fix)

**Lock Mechanism:** Build passing + 100% specification test pass rate

